Forked at tag v0.1.5 (commit 24a3517e1e97670daae1ab3e76cb4b2bc48cbd17) into
core/wakeword/src/main/kotlin. Local patch: an RMS silence gate in audio/AudioRecorder.kt that
drops buffers below an energy floor before they are ever converted or emitted, so WakeWordEngine's
ONNX inference (mel-spectrogram + embedding + classifier) never runs on silence — the dominant
CPU/battery cost of always-on wake word detection (see the "VoxCommander patch" markers in that
file). The pristine upstream source is kept as a git submodule at vendor/openwakeword-android-kt
for future diffing (see scripts/check_openwakeword_version.sh).

